{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/solar-exalted/880058-artifact-help-solar-cavalry-armor","id":880058,"title":"Artifact Help: Solar Cavalry Armor","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Exalted","Solar Exalted"],"posts":[{"date":"2016-05-02T05:06:21-07:00","id":880058,"title":"Artifact Help: Solar Cavalry Armor","content":"Hello,<br /> <br /> One of my players has taken Artifact 4 heavy armor for his character. I'm still at a bit of a loss when it comes to creating and balancing evocations.<br /> <br /> He's playing a cavalry captain and wants the armor to support the theme. He found the armor in a Solar tomb beneath his home city. The armor is orichalcum heavy plate and was blessed by Hiparkes and Darunla at the time of its creation. He wants atonement powers and evocations that support his character themes of being a mounter warrior and a war leader. I want the evocations to reflect the gods' blessings.<br /> <br /> Has anyone created similar armor artifacts that I could borrow for my game?<br /> <br /> Thanks for the help!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my RPG podcast: <a href=\"http://thestorytold.libsyn.com\" target=\"_blank\">The Story Told</a><br /> Follow my ongoing Exalted Campaign: <a href=\"https://thefallofjiara.obsidianportal.com/adventure-log\" target=\"_blank\">The Fall of Jiara</a><br /> Check out my Community Content: <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/browse.php?author=Chazz%20Kellner\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.drivethrurpg.com/browse....hazz%20Kellner</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/702-elfspeaker","name":"ElfSpeaker","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar702_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"306"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-05-02T08:26:22-07:00","id":880182,"title":"","content":"I can't say I have any that meet that criteria, but we have a few threads here that might help you. In my signature are links to the artifact/evocation workshop where people post their artifacts and help balance them (might be something there), and a link to an amatuer &quot;how to build artifacts&quot; guide that might help if you want to try your own hand at it. If you go that route, post what you make, we'll try to give feedback. Good luck, sir!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I post Artifacts in <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/823884-3e-the-artifact-and-evocation-workshop\" target=\"_blank\">this thread</a>. How I make them is in <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/828820-how-to-write-artifacts-and-evocations\" target=\"_blank\">this thread</a>.<br /> I have made many tools and other things for 3rd Edition. I now host all of my creations on my Google site: <a href=\"https://sites.google.com/site/unsungherovault/home\" target=\"_blank\">The Vault of the Unsung Hero</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/368-the-unsung-hero","name":"The Unsung Hero","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar368_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2288"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-05-02T08:49:34-07:00","id":880193,"title":"","content":"Are there anything more you can tell about his personality and fighting style (maybe his Supernal/Charm selection) ?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>The no.1 fan of Demetheus. I also draw <a href=\"https://probably-unreliable.tumblr.com/tagged/Jenart\" target=\"_blank\">Exalted</a> things and is looking for commission works ~","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/298-jen","name":"Jen","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar298_5.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3487"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-05-02T09:01:59-07:00","id":880200,"title":"","content":"Spitballing:<br /> <br /> 1. Don't make <i>everything </i>about the armor linked to being mounted. It should be personal armor first, <i>mounted </i>armor second.<br /> 2. Come up with a theme for the item. A random assortment of effects isn't compelling or fun. Make sure you understand what the armor <i>is </i>before you decide what it <i>does</i>.<br /> 3. Heavy armor + mounted = heavy cavalry = cavalry charge = the <i>Impale </i>maneuver (page 203). See what you can hang off of that.<br /> 4. One of the big pluses of being mounted is the mobility advantage. Perhaps momentum-based bonuses that accumulate as a result of combat movement? Note that this can also dovetail nicely with #3 above, since <i>Impale </i>has specific movement requirements.<br /> 5. Mounted fighters are dependent on their mount. Perhaps armor Evocations that allow the rider to extend protection to the mount as well?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Share your wonders in <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/823884-3e-the-artifact-and-evocation-workshop#post823884\" target=\"_blank\">The Artifact and Evocation Workshop</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1315-ferryman","name":"Ferryman","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1315_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"960"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-05-02T12:04:44-07:00","id":880330,"title":"","content":"Thanks, this is a good starting point.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Jen</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/solar-exalted/880058-artifact-help-solar-cavalry-armor?p=880193#post880193\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Are there anything more you can tell about his personality and fighting style (maybe his Supernal/Charm selection) ?</div> </div> </div> </div>Supernal ability is Melee. He fights with a lance/halberd type weapon and definitely wants to master the cavalry charge. Defensively, he's focusing on Resistance and Soak.<br /> <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my RPG podcast: <a href=\"http://thestorytold.libsyn.com\" target=\"_blank\">The Story Told</a><br /> Follow my ongoing Exalted Campaign: <a href=\"https://thefallofjiara.obsidianportal.com/adventure-log\" target=\"_blank\">The Fall of Jiara</a><br /> Check out my Community Content: <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/browse.php?author=Chazz%20Kellner\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.drivethrurpg.com/browse....hazz%20Kellner</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/702-elfspeaker","name":"ElfSpeaker","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar702_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"306"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-05-02T21:17:41-07:00","id":880726,"title":"","content":"Maybe an evokation to extend the armor's protections to your mount?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1047-vampire-hunter-d","name":"vampire hunter D","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1047_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1727"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-05-03T09:26:57-07:00","id":881042,"title":"","content":"Not sure if these are a little too offensive for you, since you already focus on Resistance already so I figure that you probably don't need &quot;MORE SOAK!&quot; effects.<br /> <br /> -Steal from Tiger Style's entry charm i.e when you rush someone, add the threshold successes to your attack roll. Fluff this as the armor gather velocity as you move and unleash them when the steed collide with the enemy.<br /> <br /> -An upgrade charm to increase the collision's power, knocking them back one range band if you successfully damage them with a Withering attack.<br /> <br /> -A charm that allow you to move while aiming, and you can keep aiming for as long as you like. When Decisive attack your aim's target then add the aim's dice + the number of range band you has crossed as bonus damage.<br /> <br /> -You and your horse are now on fire, so people will want to Disengage from you thus making it's easier to use the first charm.<br /> <br /> -Increase your Defense/Soak while you are Rushing someone. Probably has the &quot;On Fire&quot; charm as Prerequisite, arrows and swords tends to bounce off a flying comet.<br /> <br /> -Turn into a holy centaur ? (Sorry, I'm a big fan of Ascendant Battle Visage)<br /> <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>The no.1 fan of Demetheus. I also draw <a href=\"https://probably-unreliable.tumblr.com/tagged/Jenart\" target=\"_blank\">Exalted</a> things and is looking for commission works ~","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/298-jen","name":"Jen","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar298_5.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3487"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}